# What never goes into a container image's build: installed dependencies and builds (each image makes its own),
# local secrets, data, caches, and anything about this computer. Smaller builds, and nothing private leaks in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.claude
.datasets
.runs
mlruns
.scan
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.lighthouseci
e2e/.cache
# Models are mounted on the server, not built in — except the face landmarker the web app's build copies for browsers.
models/**
!models/third_party/face_landmarker.task
docs/zero_to_hero/zero_to_hero.html
